    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19015" root="سجو" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَجِيَّةٌ</span></b>  <i>A nature;</i> or <i>a natural, a native,</i> or <i>an
innate, disposition</i> or <i>temper</i> or <i>the like;</i> syn.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُلُقٌ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَبِيعَةٌ</span>, (S,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَرِيزَةٌ</span>: (Msb:) or <i>a
faculty,</i> or <i>quality, firmly rooted in the mind,
not easy of removal:</i> (MF:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَجَايَا</span>. (Msb.)

